[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 602.23, "timestamp": "00:10:02", "text": "我不知道這個詞。對我來說，音樂和音樂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 606.23, "timestamp": "00:10:06", "text": "都是很難的選擇。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 609.43, "timestamp": "00:10:09", "text": "現在這取決於個人電腦了。如果你的電腦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 610.47, "timestamp": "00:10:10", "text": "運作不了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 612.55, "timestamp": "00:10:12", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 615.509, "timestamp": "00:10:15", "text": "我的電腦都帶不動。好的。 PNG。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 622.79, "timestamp": "00:10:22", "text": "所以，如果我說是基於選擇，而不是基於"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 624.55, "timestamp": "00:10:24", "text": "PC，那我當然就不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 628.71, "timestamp": "00:10:28", "text": "說出我的選擇。我覺得現在的生活"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 631.67, "timestamp": "00:10:31", "text": "更好了，因為它有了YouTube部落客們那種真實的感覺，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 634.069, "timestamp": "00:10:34", "text": "就像是第一個YouTube部落客的時候一樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 636.15, "timestamp": "00:10:36", "text": "是的。我的意思是，是啊，兩天的生活太"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 637.67, "timestamp": "00:10:37", "text": "瘋狂了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 638.79, "timestamp": "00:10:38", "text": "對吧？ [清喉嚨] 是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 639.91, "timestamp": "00:10:39", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 641.59, "timestamp": "00:10:41", "text": "但是要獲得一個真實的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.269, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "二維模型太難了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 646.47, "timestamp": "00:10:46", "text": "它超級貴。 [笑聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 649.269, "timestamp": "00:10:49", "text": "對，我就是這個意思。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 651.99, "timestamp": "00:10:51", "text": "對於 3D 遊戲，你需要一塊好的顯示卡和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 656.949, "timestamp": "00:10:56", "text": "230 GB 的硬碟空間。哦，是的。真的。以及追蹤器"}]